# Copy / i18n

- The app opens in pt-BR. A stored `rigbench.locale` of `en` or `pt-BR` wins. English is the switch.
- `en.ts` is the key schema; `pt-BR.ts` must mirror keys and interpolation params 1:1. Policy: [docs/current/intention-workbench.md](../../docs/current/intention-workbench.md) (Language).
- Read strings with `t('key')` or `useT()` — no hardcoded UI English/Portuguese in JSX.
- Do not translate pedal tone/amp/PCM names; keep device map strings as on hardware.
- After edits: `npm run check:copy` (also runs inside `npm run build`).
